 Comment			:	1. If the given EmployeeId Is Already Exits In EmployeeSalaryDetails Table, Then Update the EmployeeSalaryDetails Table Have the Column of
										PayTypeId				AS  @PayTypeId		  
										,PaymentTypeId			AS  @PaymentTypeId
